{"page":226,"width":2000,"height":2831,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"3.5 • 연결지향형 트랜스포트 TCP","words":[{"text":"3.5","x":959,"y":146,"width":41,"height":24},{"text":"•","x":1033,"y":150,"width":12,"height":13},{"text":"연결지향형","x":1079,"y":144,"width":128,"height":30},{"text":"트랜스포트","x":1219,"y":145,"width":129,"height":29},{"text":"TCP","x":1372,"y":146,"width":62,"height":26}]},{"text":"이 마지막 예 또한 중요하면서도 민감한 문제다. 호스트 A는 세 번째 세그먼트","words":[{"text":"이","x":240,"y":269,"width":29,"height":38},{"text":"마지막","x":290,"y":270,"width":104,"height":38},{"text":"예","x":411,"y":271,"width":28,"height":37},{"text":"또한","x":460,"y":272,"width":65,"height":36},{"text":"중요하면서도","x":541,"y":273,"width":196,"height":37},{"text":"민감한","x":757,"y":273,"width":95,"height":37},{"text":"문제다.","x":867,"y":273,"width":106,"height":37},{"text":"호스트","x":993,"y":274,"width":100,"height":30},{"text":"A는","x":1112,"y":273,"width":60,"height":35},{"text":"세","x":1190,"y":270,"width":29,"height":38},{"text":"번째","x":1241,"y":271,"width":61,"height":37},{"text":"세그먼트","x":1322,"y":271,"width":133,"height":37}]},{"text":"(90()~1,(脚 값의 바이트)를 두 번째 세그먼트(536~899값의 바이트)가 수신되기 전","words":[{"text":"(90()~1,(脚","x":174,"y":335,"width":192,"height":36},{"text":"값의","x":382,"y":332,"width":62,"height":38},{"text":"바이트)를","x":462,"y":332,"width":142,"height":39},{"text":"두","x":618,"y":335,"width":33,"height":35},{"text":"번째","x":667,"y":333,"width":60,"height":37},{"text":"세그먼트(536~899값의","x":745,"y":331,"width":352,"height":41},{"text":"바이트)가","x":1116,"y":330,"width":146,"height":39},{"text":"수신되기","x":1276,"y":331,"width":129,"height":37},{"text":"전","x":1425,"y":331,"width":30,"height":36}]},{"text":"에 수신하였다. 그러므로 세 번째 세그먼트는 순서가 들리게 도착하였다. 민감한 문제","words":[{"text":"에","x":175,"y":393,"width":29,"height":37},{"text":"수신하였다.","x":221,"y":392,"width":177,"height":38},{"text":"그러므로","x":414,"y":392,"width":131,"height":37},{"text":"세","x":559,"y":392,"width":29,"height":37},{"text":"번째","x":607,"y":393,"width":59,"height":37},{"text":"세그먼트는","x":684,"y":393,"width":162,"height":37},{"text":"순서가","x":859,"y":393,"width":99,"height":37},{"text":"들리게","x":972,"y":392,"width":97,"height":37},{"text":"도착하였다.","x":1086,"y":391,"width":174,"height":37},{"text":"민감한","x":1279,"y":390,"width":99,"height":37},{"text":"문제","x":1391,"y":391,"width":63,"height":36}]},{"text":"는 TCP 연결에서 순서가 들린 세그먼트를 수신할 때 호스트는 어떤 행동-을 하는가에","words":[{"text":"는","x":174,"y":456,"width":33,"height":34},{"text":"TCP","x":220,"y":457,"width":72,"height":29},{"text":"연결에서","x":309,"y":453,"width":127,"height":37},{"text":"순서가","x":454,"y":453,"width":99,"height":37},{"text":"들린","x":566,"y":453,"width":63,"height":36},{"text":"세그먼트를","x":646,"y":453,"width":162,"height":37},{"text":"수신할","x":822,"y":453,"width":99,"height":37},{"text":"때","x":935,"y":452,"width":28,"height":38},{"text":"호스트는","x":981,"y":454,"width":134,"height":34},{"text":"어떤","x":1131,"y":451,"width":63,"height":37},{"text":"행동-을","x":1211,"y":451,"width":100,"height":37},{"text":"하는가에","x":1325,"y":451,"width":129,"height":37}]},{"text":"대한 것이다. 흥미롭게도, TCP RFC는 여기에 어떤 규칙도 부여하지 않았고 TCP 구","words":[{"text":"대한","x":175,"y":513,"width":66,"height":37},{"text":"것이다.","x":256,"y":513,"width":108,"height":37},{"text":"흥미롭게도,","x":381,"y":513,"width":172,"height":38},{"text":"TCP","x":568,"y":517,"width":69,"height":29},{"text":"RFC는","x":653,"y":515,"width":102,"height":35},{"text":"여기에","x":771,"y":513,"width":93,"height":38},{"text":"어떤","x":883,"y":513,"width":63,"height":37},{"text":"규칙도","x":962,"y":512,"width":101,"height":38},{"text":"부여하지","x":1078,"y":511,"width":130,"height":38},{"text":"않았고","x":1227,"y":511,"width":99,"height":38},{"text":"TCP","x":1339,"y":515,"width":71,"height":30},{"text":"구","x":1425,"y":513,"width":33,"height":35}]},{"text":"현 개발자에게 맡기고 있다. 기본적으로 다음처럼 두 가지 선택이 있다. (1) 수신자가","words":[{"text":"현","x":175,"y":574,"width":29,"height":36},{"text":"개발자에게","x":222,"y":574,"width":164,"height":37},{"text":"맡기고","x":405,"y":574,"width":98,"height":36},{"text":"있다.","x":519,"y":573,"width":70,"height":37},{"text":"기본적으로","x":608,"y":574,"width":161,"height":36},{"text":"다음처럼","x":785,"y":573,"width":126,"height":38},{"text":"두","x":930,"y":575,"width":33,"height":35},{"text":"가지","x":979,"y":572,"width":62,"height":38},{"text":"선택이","x":1061,"y":572,"width":96,"height":37},{"text":"있다.","x":1178,"y":572,"width":72,"height":37},{"text":"(1)","x":1267,"y":576,"width":42,"height":34},{"text":"수신자가","x":1326,"y":572,"width":134,"height":37}]},{"text":"순서가 들린 세그먼트를 즉시 버린다(즉, 앞에서 설명했듯이, 이는 수신자 설계를 단순","words":[{"text":"순서가","x":173,"y":634,"width":101,"height":36},{"text":"들린","x":286,"y":634,"width":65,"height":37},{"text":"세그먼트를","x":366,"y":634,"width":166,"height":37},{"text":"즉시","x":543,"y":633,"width":62,"height":38},{"text":"버린다(즉,","x":623,"y":634,"width":148,"height":38},{"text":"앞에서","x":787,"y":634,"width":94,"height":37},{"text":"설명했듯이,","x":898,"y":632,"width":175,"height":38},{"text":"이는","x":1089,"y":633,"width":66,"height":37},{"text":"수신자","x":1167,"y":632,"width":102,"height":38},{"text":"설계를","x":1281,"y":632,"width":100,"height":37},{"text":"단순","x":1394,"y":632,"width":67,"height":36}]},{"text":"화할 수 있다). (2) 수신자는 순서가 들린 데이터를 보유하고, 빈 공간에 잃어버린 데이","words":[{"text":"화할","x":173,"y":694,"width":67,"height":37},{"text":"수","x":252,"y":695,"width":33,"height":36},{"text":"있다).","x":299,"y":695,"width":86,"height":38},{"text":"(2)","x":399,"y":699,"width":43,"height":35},{"text":"수신자는","x":455,"y":694,"width":132,"height":37},{"text":"순서가","x":599,"y":694,"width":99,"height":37},{"text":"들린","x":709,"y":694,"width":64,"height":36},{"text":"데이터를","x":788,"y":694,"width":130,"height":37},{"text":"보유하고,","x":930,"y":693,"width":143,"height":38},{"text":"빈","x":1090,"y":693,"width":30,"height":36},{"text":"공간에","x":1133,"y":692,"width":99,"height":38},{"text":"잃어버린","x":1249,"y":692,"width":131,"height":38},{"text":"데이","x":1396,"y":692,"width":62,"height":36}]},{"text":"터를 재우기 위해서 기다린다. 확실히 후자가 네트워크 밴드폭 관점에서는 효율적이","words":[{"text":"터를","x":175,"y":756,"width":64,"height":36},{"text":"재우기","x":256,"y":755,"width":95,"height":37},{"text":"위해서","x":374,"y":755,"width":94,"height":38},{"text":"기다린다.","x":491,"y":754,"width":136,"height":38},{"text":"확실히","x":645,"y":755,"width":93,"height":37},{"text":"후자가","x":758,"y":754,"width":100,"height":38},{"text":"네트워크","x":875,"y":754,"width":132,"height":37},{"text":"밴드폭","x":1026,"y":754,"width":100,"height":37},{"text":"관점에서는","x":1141,"y":753,"width":170,"height":37},{"text":"효율적이","x":1328,"y":752,"width":131,"height":37}]},{"text":"며, 실제에서도 취하는 방법이다.","words":[{"text":"며,","x":174,"y":816,"width":38,"height":37},{"text":"실제에서도","x":228,"y":816,"width":167,"height":37},{"text":"취하는","x":409,"y":816,"width":98,"height":37},{"text":"방법이다.","x":520,"y":815,"width":136,"height":38}]},{"text":"그림 330에서 시작 순서번호가 0이라고 가정했다. 실제로 TCP 연결의 양쪽 모두","words":[{"text":"그림","x":237,"y":876,"width":62,"height":36},{"text":"330에서","x":316,"y":877,"width":130,"height":37},{"text":"시작","x":464,"y":876,"width":66,"height":37},{"text":"순서번호가","x":541,"y":876,"width":165,"height":37},{"text":"0이라고","x":717,"y":875,"width":117,"height":38},{"text":"가정했다.","x":848,"y":874,"width":141,"height":38},{"text":"실제로","x":1005,"y":874,"width":100,"height":38},{"text":"TCP","x":1116,"y":878,"width":72,"height":29},{"text":"연결의","x":1204,"y":874,"width":95,"height":37},{"text":"양쪽","x":1317,"y":874,"width":66,"height":37},{"text":"모두","x":1396,"y":874,"width":68,"height":35}]},{"text":"시작 순서 번호를 임의로 선택한다. 이것은 두 호스트 사이에 이미 종료된 연결로부터","words":[{"text":"시작","x":173,"y":936,"width":64,"height":37},{"text":"순서","x":250,"y":936,"width":63,"height":37},{"text":"번호를","x":333,"y":936,"width":99,"height":37},{"text":"임의로","x":447,"y":936,"width":97,"height":37},{"text":"선택한다.","x":559,"y":936,"width":137,"height":37},{"text":"이것은","x":713,"y":936,"width":97,"height":38},{"text":"두","x":823,"y":937,"width":33,"height":36},{"text":"호스트","x":870,"y":937,"width":99,"height":31},{"text":"사이에","x":983,"y":935,"width":99,"height":37},{"text":"이미","x":1100,"y":934,"width":62,"height":38},{"text":"종료된","x":1178,"y":934,"width":102,"height":37},{"text":"연결로부터","x":1296,"y":934,"width":163,"height":36}]},{"text":"아직 네트워크에 남아 있던 세그먼트가 같은 두 호스트 간의 나중 연결(또한 이전의","words":[{"text":"아직","x":172,"y":997,"width":60,"height":37},{"text":"네트워크에","x":254,"y":996,"width":164,"height":38},{"text":"남아","x":438,"y":997,"width":66,"height":36},{"text":"있던","x":522,"y":997,"width":61,"height":37},{"text":"세그먼트가","x":602,"y":996,"width":164,"height":38},{"text":"같은","x":782,"y":996,"width":65,"height":37},{"text":"두","x":863,"y":997,"width":33,"height":36},{"text":"호스트","x":913,"y":997,"width":100,"height":31},{"text":"간의","x":1030,"y":995,"width":64,"height":38},{"text":"나중","x":1114,"y":995,"width":68,"height":37},{"text":"연결(또한","x":1200,"y":995,"width":147,"height":38},{"text":"이전의","x":1364,"y":994,"width":97,"height":37}]},{"text":"연결과 같은 포트 번호를 사용해서 발생)에서 유효한 세그먼트로 오인될 확률을 최소","words":[{"text":"연결과","x":174,"y":1057,"width":96,"height":37},{"text":"같은","x":285,"y":1056,"width":66,"height":37},{"text":"포트","x":366,"y":1060,"width":66,"height":28},{"text":"번호를","x":449,"y":1057,"width":98,"height":36},{"text":"사용해서","x":561,"y":1057,"width":127,"height":37},{"text":"발생)에서","x":708,"y":1056,"width":139,"height":39},{"text":"유효한","x":865,"y":1056,"width":102,"height":37},{"text":"세그먼트로","x":981,"y":1056,"width":169,"height":37},{"text":"오인될","x":1164,"y":1055,"width":99,"height":37},{"text":"확률을","x":1280,"y":1055,"width":102,"height":37},{"text":"최소","x":1397,"y":1055,"width":67,"height":37}]},{"text":"화 한다[Sunshine 1978].","words":[{"text":"화","x":172,"y":1118,"width":33,"height":37},{"text":"한다[Sunshine","x":216,"y":1117,"width":219,"height":39},{"text":"1978].","x":451,"y":1121,"width":92,"height":35}]},{"text":"텔넷(Telnet): 순서번호와 획인번호 사래 연구","words":[{"text":"텔넷(Telnet):","x":173,"y":1221,"width":221,"height":43},{"text":"순서번호와","x":407,"y":1222,"width":176,"height":42},{"text":"획인번호","x":589,"y":1221,"width":139,"height":43},{"text":"사래","x":736,"y":1222,"width":68,"height":35},{"text":"연구","x":814,"y":1222,"width":71,"height":40}]},{"text":"RFC 854에서 정의된 텔넷은 원격 로그인을 위해 사용되는 유명한 애플리케이션 계층","words":[{"text":"RFC","x":171,"y":1298,"width":69,"height":29},{"text":"854에서","x":254,"y":1294,"width":121,"height":37},{"text":"정의된","x":394,"y":1294,"width":97,"height":37},{"text":"텔넷은","x":506,"y":1294,"width":98,"height":37},{"text":"원격","x":618,"y":1294,"width":60,"height":37},{"text":"로그인을","x":695,"y":1294,"width":132,"height":36},{"text":"위해","x":840,"y":1293,"width":63,"height":37},{"text":"사용되는","x":919,"y":1294,"width":136,"height":37},{"text":"유명한","x":1067,"y":1294,"width":103,"height":38},{"text":"애플리케이션","x":1183,"y":1295,"width":200,"height":37},{"text":"계층","x":1398,"y":1294,"width":66,"height":38}]},{"text":"프로토콜이다. 이것은 TCP상에서 동작하며, 한 쌍의 호스트들 사이에서 동작하도록","words":[{"text":"프로토콜이다.","x":171,"y":1354,"width":206,"height":37},{"text":"이것은","x":398,"y":1355,"width":100,"height":37},{"text":"TCP상에서","x":513,"y":1354,"width":165,"height":38},{"text":"동작하며,","x":698,"y":1354,"width":141,"height":38},{"text":"한","x":857,"y":1354,"width":35,"height":36},{"text":"쌍의","x":906,"y":1354,"width":65,"height":37},{"text":"호스트들","x":990,"y":1356,"width":137,"height":35},{"text":"사이에서","x":1144,"y":1355,"width":131,"height":37},{"text":"동작하도록","x":1296,"y":1355,"width":168,"height":38}]},{"text":"설계되었다. 2장에서 논의된 대량 데이터 전송 애플리케이션과 달리, 텔넷은 대화형","words":[{"text":"설계되었다.","x":171,"y":1414,"width":173,"height":38},{"text":"2장에서","x":363,"y":1415,"width":116,"height":38},{"text":"논의된","x":499,"y":1415,"width":100,"height":37},{"text":"대량","x":617,"y":1415,"width":65,"height":37},{"text":"데이터","x":699,"y":1414,"width":94,"height":38},{"text":"전송","x":816,"y":1414,"width":65,"height":37},{"text":"애플리케이션과","x":898,"y":1414,"width":238,"height":39},{"text":"달리,","x":1152,"y":1416,"width":75,"height":37},{"text":"텔넷은","x":1247,"y":1416,"width":100,"height":37},{"text":"대화형","x":1365,"y":1416,"width":94,"height":38}]},{"text":"애플리케이션이다. 이 절에서는 텔넷의 예를 논의하는데, 이것은 TCP 순서와 확인응","words":[{"text":"애플리케이션이다.","x":171,"y":1475,"width":273,"height":38},{"text":"이","x":463,"y":1476,"width":28,"height":37},{"text":"절에서는","x":511,"y":1475,"width":132,"height":38},{"text":"텔넷의","x":658,"y":1475,"width":95,"height":37},{"text":"예를","x":772,"y":1475,"width":66,"height":37},{"text":"논의하는데,","x":851,"y":1475,"width":176,"height":38},{"text":"이것은","x":1046,"y":1476,"width":101,"height":37},{"text":"TCP","x":1160,"y":1480,"width":72,"height":29},{"text":"순서와","x":1247,"y":1477,"width":103,"height":37},{"text":"확인응","x":1363,"y":1477,"width":101,"height":38}]},{"text":"답 번호를 설명하는 데 편하기 때문이다. 패스워드를 포함하는 텔넷 연결에서 전송된","words":[{"text":"답","x":169,"y":1534,"width":32,"height":37},{"text":"번호를","x":218,"y":1535,"width":98,"height":37},{"text":"설명하는","x":332,"y":1536,"width":134,"height":38},{"text":"데","x":482,"y":1537,"width":28,"height":37},{"text":"편하기","x":530,"y":1536,"width":94,"height":38},{"text":"때문이다.","x":644,"y":1536,"width":138,"height":38},{"text":"패스워드를","x":801,"y":1536,"width":166,"height":38},{"text":"포함하는","x":981,"y":1536,"width":136,"height":39},{"text":"텔넷","x":1132,"y":1537,"width":65,"height":38},{"text":"연결에서","x":1216,"y":1537,"width":129,"height":38},{"text":"전송된","x":1365,"y":1537,"width":98,"height":38}]},{"text":"데이터는 암호화되지 않아서(8.7절에 논의된 것처럼) 도청 공격에 취약하므퇴 많은","words":[{"text":"데이터는","x":171,"y":1595,"width":132,"height":38},{"text":"암호화되지","x":320,"y":1597,"width":164,"height":38},{"text":"않아서(8.7절에","x":506,"y":1597,"width":225,"height":39},{"text":"논의된","x":750,"y":1597,"width":100,"height":38},{"text":"것처럼)","x":869,"y":1598,"width":111,"height":39},{"text":"도청","x":998,"y":1598,"width":63,"height":38},{"text":"공격에","x":1082,"y":1598,"width":99,"height":38},{"text":"취약하므퇴","x":1202,"y":1599,"width":177,"height":37},{"text":"많은","x":1398,"y":1598,"width":68,"height":39}]},{"text":"A卜공자들이 텔넷보다 SSH 프로토콜을 선호한다.","words":[{"text":"A卜공자들이","x":169,"y":1656,"width":162,"height":39},{"text":"텔넷보다","x":349,"y":1658,"width":134,"height":37},{"text":"SSH","x":494,"y":1662,"width":69,"height":29},{"text":"프로토콜을","x":576,"y":1658,"width":169,"height":37},{"text":"선호한다.","x":757,"y":1658,"width":139,"height":38}]},{"text":"호스트 A가 호스트 B와 텔넷 세션을 초기화한다고 가정하자. 호스트 A가 세션을","words":[{"text":"호스트","x":233,"y":1721,"width":101,"height":30},{"text":"A가","x":347,"y":1719,"width":63,"height":37},{"text":"호스트","x":422,"y":1721,"width":101,"height":30},{"text":"B와","x":536,"y":1719,"width":61,"height":38},{"text":"텔넷","x":610,"y":1719,"width":64,"height":38},{"text":"세션을","x":690,"y":1720,"width":100,"height":37},{"text":"초기화한다고","x":802,"y":1720,"width":201,"height":38},{"text":"가정하자.","x":1016,"y":1720,"width":142,"height":38},{"text":"호스트","x":1173,"y":1723,"width":103,"height":30},{"text":"A가","x":1288,"y":1721,"width":64,"height":37},{"text":"세션을","x":1364,"y":1720,"width":102,"height":37}]},{"text":"초기화하므로 클라이언트이고 호스트 B는 서버가 된다. 사용자(클라이언트에서)가 입","words":[{"text":"초기화하므로","x":170,"y":1780,"width":200,"height":38},{"text":"클라이언트이고","x":382,"y":1780,"width":237,"height":38},{"text":"호스트","x":633,"y":1782,"width":100,"height":31},{"text":"B는","x":746,"y":1783,"width":59,"height":34},{"text":"서버가","x":818,"y":1781,"width":100,"height":38},{"text":"된다.","x":931,"y":1782,"width":73,"height":37},{"text":"사용자(클라이언트에서)가","x":1020,"y":1781,"width":399,"height":40},{"text":"입","x":1434,"y":1781,"width":27,"height":36}]},{"text":"력한 각 문자는 원격 호스트에게 송신될 것이다. 원격 호스트는 각 문자의 복사본을 송","words":[{"text":"력한","x":172,"y":1841,"width":63,"height":38},{"text":"각","x":247,"y":1841,"width":33,"height":37},{"text":"문자는","x":292,"y":1841,"width":102,"height":37},{"text":"원격","x":407,"y":1841,"width":62,"height":37},{"text":"호스트에게","x":486,"y":1842,"width":165,"height":38},{"text":"송신될","x":665,"y":1842,"width":99,"height":38},{"text":"것이다.","x":780,"y":1842,"width":105,"height":38},{"text":"원격","x":900,"y":1843,"width":61,"height":37},{"text":"호스트는","x":977,"y":1845,"width":135,"height":34},{"text":"각","x":1124,"y":1842,"width":34,"height":38},{"text":"문자의","x":1169,"y":1843,"width":99,"height":37},{"text":"복사본을","x":1283,"y":1842,"width":136,"height":37},{"text":"송","x":1431,"y":1842,"width":34,"height":38}]},{"text":"신자에게 반송하여 텔넷 사용자의 화면에 표시되게 할 것이다. 이 “반송(echo back)”","words":[{"text":"신자에게","x":171,"y":1903,"width":127,"height":38},{"text":"반송하여","x":317,"y":1903,"width":131,"height":37},{"text":"텔넷","x":469,"y":1903,"width":64,"height":37},{"text":"사용자의","x":550,"y":1903,"width":131,"height":38},{"text":"화면에","x":700,"y":1903,"width":96,"height":39},{"text":"표시되게","x":813,"y":1903,"width":130,"height":38},{"text":"할","x":960,"y":1904,"width":35,"height":36},{"text":"것이다.","x":1010,"y":1903,"width":106,"height":39},{"text":"이","x":1135,"y":1904,"width":28,"height":37},{"text":"“반송(echo","x":1182,"y":1904,"width":166,"height":39},{"text":"back)”","x":1364,"y":1903,"width":100,"height":39}]},{"text":"은 텔넷 사용자가 보는 문자가 이미 원격 사이트에 수신되고 처리되었음을 나타낸다.","words":[{"text":"은","x":169,"y":1965,"width":33,"height":36},{"text":"텔넷","x":218,"y":1964,"width":63,"height":38},{"text":"사용자가","x":297,"y":1964,"width":137,"height":38},{"text":"보는","x":448,"y":1966,"width":69,"height":34},{"text":"문자가","x":530,"y":1964,"width":103,"height":39},{"text":"이미","x":648,"y":1965,"width":61,"height":38},{"text":"원격","x":729,"y":1964,"width":61,"height":38},{"text":"사이트에","x":808,"y":1964,"width":129,"height":38},{"text":"수신되고","x":954,"y":1965,"width":134,"height":38},{"text":"처리되었음을","x":1104,"y":1965,"width":202,"height":37},{"text":"나타낸다.","x":1321,"y":1964,"width":142,"height":38}]},{"text":"그러므로 각 문자는 사용자가 기를 누르는 시간과 문자가 사용자의 모니터에 표시되는","words":[{"text":"그러므로","x":170,"y":2026,"width":131,"height":38},{"text":"각","x":314,"y":2025,"width":34,"height":39},{"text":"문자는","x":360,"y":2025,"width":102,"height":39},{"text":"사용자가","x":474,"y